{"slug":"krank-berlin-129ru6","title":"Krank: Berlin","titleEn":"Krank: Berlin","type":"series","year":2025,"rating":7.3,"duration":45,"description":"Berlin ER is a German medical drama television series created by Samuel Jefferson and Viktor Jakovleski for Apple TV+ and ZDF. Produced by Alexis von Wittgenstein and Henning Kamm, the themes of Berlin ER were inspired by Jefferson's past experience working as a doctor in a London emergency room. The series follows emergency department staff at a fictional Neukölln hospital in Berlin as they face medical, interpersonal, and systematic issues. The first series began airing on February 26, 2025, and went on to win \"Best Drama Series\" at the 2025 German Television Awards. A second series is expected in 2026.","genres":["درام"],"poster":"/covers/tt28529513/poster.jpg","backdrop":"/covers/tt28529513/backdrop.jpg","posterUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt28529513/img","backdropUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt28529513/img","videoUrl":"","trailerUrl":null,"director":"","cast":["Haley Louise Jones","Slavko Popadic","Bernhard Schütz"],"country":"آلمان","ageRating":"+13","quality":"HD","sources":[],"featured":false,"trendingScore":0,"views":0,"source":"f2m","addedAt":"2026-09-13T23:26:35.888Z","episodes":[{"season":1,"number":1,"name":"قسمت 1","synopsis":"","duration":45,"videoUrl":"https://bvxbbajdhgxd9g87jwb463wx.abrtech.top/yA3f/Series_09/Krank.Berlin/S01/Krank.Berlin.S01E01.1080p.WEB-DL.6CH.Farsi.Sub.Film2Media.mkv","sources":[],"thumbnail":"/api/cover/krank-berlin-129ru6.svg"},{"season":1,"number":2,"name":"قسمت 2","synopsis":"","duration":45,"videoUrl":"https://bvxbbajdhgxd9g87jwb463wx.abrtech.top/yA3f/Series_09/Krank.Berlin/S01/Krank.Berlin.S01E02.1080p.WEB-DL.6CH.Farsi.Sub.Film2Media.mkv","sources":[],"thumbnail":"/api/cover/krank-berlin-129ru6.svg"},{"season":1,"number":3,"name":"قسمت 3","synopsis":"","duration":45,"videoUrl":"https://bvxbbajdhgxd9g87jwb463wx.abrtech.top/yA3f/Seri